.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "snakepit env" 1  "snakepit env " 
.SH NAME
snakepit env \- ⚙️  Show or manage the persistent snakepit environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnakepit env\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
⚙️  Show or manage the persistent snakepit environment
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
snakepit env\-status(1)
📊 Show the persistent environment status and path
.TP
snakepit env\-init(1)
🏗️  Create or recreate the persistent environment
.TP
snakepit env\-destroy(1)
💥 Remove the persistent environment
.TP
snakepit env\-path(1)
📍 Show the Python path for shell integration
.TP
snakepit env\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
